  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Southeast Asia Clean Energy Fund II, L.P.</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">An equity investment of up to $5 million in Southeast Asia Clean Energy Fund II, LP a targeted $175 million regional private equity fund. SEACEF II will invest in early-stage infrastructure companies that utilize scalable business models and proven low carbon technologies in Southeast Asia to accelerate climate transition by materially avoiding or reducing greenhouse gas emissions through its investments.</narrative>
  </description>
